  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Gold-tone stainless steel case and bracelet. Fixed gold-tone bezel with crystal set. Brown dial with gold-tone hands and index-Roman numeral hour markers. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 6 o'clock position. Quartz movement. Scratch resistant mineral crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 38 mm, case thickness: 12 mm. Band width: 20 mm. Deployment clasp. Water resistant at 100 meters / 330 feet. Functions: chronograph, hour, minute, second. Lexington Series. Dress watch style. Michael Kors Lexington Pave Chronograph Quartz Brown Dial Ladies Watch MK7276.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Michael Kors</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Lexington</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">MK7276</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Women's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Movement</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Quartz</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; fo